docs {
  P2.5 privacy and retention: org retention settings (validation 1..365),
  the privacy view of the main event, "erase now" refused for an event
  that has not ended, and a full manual purge of a separate event that
  ended three days ago (typed-title confirm): guests come back as erased
  rows and the CSV export and new guests answer 409 event_purged.
  Retention is set back to 30 days at the end.
}
